Description: Ten-year risks of nephropathy, retinopathy, neuropathy,
    myocardial infarction or stroke, congestive heart failure and death in
    adults with type 2 diabetes, from the Risk Equations for Complications Of
    type 2 Diabetes (Basu et al., Lancet Diabetes Endocrinol 2017
    <doi:10.1016/S2213-8587(17)30221-8>), as implemented in the authors'
    calculator. Non-commercial use only; see LICENSE.
